{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54017","headline":"大隐赋附歌 三 · 皇甫松","name":"大隐赋附歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道由由（一作「悠悠」）而熙熙，吾莫知施谁宗，栾子吾其嗣之。\n至化荡荡而一一，吾莫知专谁师，栾子吾其与焉。\n（此首招隐者歌。\n均见《文苑英华》卷九九）（按：檀栾子爲皇甫松自号。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}